# Generated evidence packages.
#
# Not committed, and the reason is section 38 rather than tidiness. A package is
# bound to the exact commit it was taken against, so committing it would produce
# a new commit that the package no longer proves anything about. Evidence is
# published as a build artifact against the commit it describes; a copy checked
# into the tree would be stale the moment it landed.
xiv-evidence/
